bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Rating Like Button (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control RatingController
control RatingLikeService
entity ":RatingLikeModel" as RatingLikeModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Like / Unlike rating
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /rating/toggle
activate Router

Router -> RatingController: 3. toggle(ratingId)
activate RatingController

RatingController -> RatingController: 4. Validate request
activate RatingController
space
deactivate RatingController

loop User role not authorized / Rating missing / Invalid ratingId type
    RatingController --> Router: 4.1.1. 401 Unauthorized
    Router --> UI: 4.1.2. Show error
    UI --> User: 4.1.3. Show error
end

RatingController -> RatingLikeService: 5. toggleLike(ratingId, userId)
activate RatingLikeService

RatingLikeService -> RatingLikeModel: 6. Find existing like
activate RatingLikeModel
RatingLikeModel -> MongoDB: 7. findOne({ ratingId, userId })
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> RatingLikeModel: 8. Like document / null
deactivate MongoDB
RatingLikeModel --> RatingLikeService: 9. Existing like
deactivate RatingLikeModel

RatingLikeService -> RatingLikeService: 10. Check existing like
activate RatingLikeService
space
deactivate RatingLikeService

opt Already liked (UNLIKE)
    ref over RatingLikeService, MongoDB: 3.40.b.i. Subsequence - React rating 1
    RatingLikeService -> RatingLikeService: 10.1. Check error
    activate RatingLikeService
    space
    deactivate RatingLikeService

    opt Have error
        RatingLikeService --> RatingController: 10.1.1. Return unliked & likesCount
        RatingController --> Router: 10.1.2. HTTP response
        Router --> UI: 10.1.3. Update like UI
        UI --> User: 10.1.4. Show like state
    end
end

ref over RatingLikeService, MongoDB: 3.40.b.ii. Subsequence - React rating 2

RatingLikeService --> RatingController: 11. Return liked & likesCount
deactivate RatingLikeService

RatingController --> Router: 12. HTTP response
deactivate RatingController

Router --> UI: 13. Update like UI
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 14. Show like state
deactivate UI
deactivate User